      "rangeLabel": "Questions 491–493",
      "contextType": "figure",
      "marker": "Questions 491 through 493.",
      "context": "The following figure shows the foreign direct investment (FDI) inflow to\n Africa in billions of dollars from 1990 to 2010.",
