          "text": "573. What name is given to a substance that speeds up the rate of a\n     reaction by decreasing the activation energy needed for the reactants\n     to turn into products?\n     (A) a noble gas\n     (B) a compound\n     (C) an alloy\n     (D) a catalyst",
