          "text": "641. The following table shows the pH of several substances.\n\n  Substance pH\n\n Water        7\n Vinegar      2\n Baking soda 8\n Lime juice   3\n\n     Which of the substances is/are acidic?\n     (A) water\n     (B) baking soda\n     (C) vinegar and baking soda\n     (D) lime juice and vinegar\n\nUse the following information for",
