          "text": "741. Based on the passage, which of the following is a true statement?\n    (A) The ideal kitchen is a sprawling environment with a fabulous\n      working space.\n    (B) The ideal kitchen is a comfortable environment with an efficient\n      working space.\n    (C) The ideal kitchen is a cramped environment with an efficient\n      working space.\n\n   (D) The ideal kitchen is an efficient environment with comfortable\n     working space.",
