          "number": 839,
          "text": "839. According to the passage, the wall of the hospital ward is being\n   decorated with a mural in honor of whom?\n   (A) Dr. Benjamin Hitz\n   (B) the writer of a popular song\n   (C) a man who had volunteered to die\n   (D) the hospital’s chief obstetrician",
          "sourcePage": 351
